  "diagram_notes": [
    {
      "content": "## Disclaimer\n\nThis story is an investigation and triage workflow. It does not prove that a website, account, image, or domain is fraudulent, malicious, or affiliated with ABC Ltd.\nThe workflow uses a mixture of URL allowlisting, VirusTotal domain intelligence, webpage screenshots, OCR, logo detection, and AI-generated analysis. These sources can be incomplete, inaccurate, delayed, manipulated, or unavailable. A clean VirusTotal result, a matching logo, or a matching brand name must not be treated as conclusive evidence on its own.\nAI outputs are advisory. An analyst must review the submitted URL, screenshot, OCR text, detected logos, domain-reputation data, and the AI reasoning before taking any enforcement, takedown, account-disable, customer-contact, or legal action.\nABC Ltd, `abc.com`, the leadership entries, brand aliases, and logo terms are placeholders. Replace them with verified company information before operational use. Maintain the approved-domain list, leadership list, known scam phrases, and suspicious-domain terms as brand intelligence changes.\nOnly submit URLs that your organization is authorized to investigate. Submitted URLs, screenshots, OCR text, and reputation requests are sent to configured third-party services, including Restpack, Google Cloud Vision, VirusTotal, and the selected AI provider. Use credentials, data retention, and sharing settings that comply with your organization’s security, privacy, and legal requirements.\nThe workflow skips approved ABC domains to reduce unnecessary analysis. A skipped domain is not evidence that the website is secure; it only means the hostname matched the configured allowlist.\n",
      "position": [
        -180,
        -600
      ],
      "guid": "ecd2bc090440313e922a9b7f91500fe8",
      "width": 960
    },
